{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1000_p", "source_sha256": "932e30090d8729367c62651bbf44cf6b5c67d7afbb9f2814768b447d9777deea", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か。\nそろそろ控え室に行く用意を……。", "zh": "哎呀，已经这么晚了啊。\n差不多该准备去休息室了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1001_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cec0995f6ef6ef84559a4ceee450587a670f323c1a3ca943449d63225181f552", "ja": "電話……雑誌社から？\nはい、765プロの{$P$}です！", "zh": "电话……是杂志社打来的吗？\n好的，我是765事务所的{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "a208f5cf1f37946203186761aec4fe175b71b0614224702d1e4899ef1714dfcf", "ja": "けど風花ちゃんも、最近、雑誌の表紙を\nやってたわよね？　ふたりともすごいわ。", "zh": "不过，风花最近也登上过杂志封面吧？你们两个都好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a262b6a27923323834a27d7cf5afde72960aafdb2ae9093eaf4129ddd6e47efe", "ja": "あ、えっと……私の場合は、その……\nみ、水着のグラビアが多いので……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我这边的话，是因为……\n泳装写真的工作比较多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7b81f77f3e243add341889d72a1a033d2b333935893e1519a06234ab7b808c62", "ja": "あ、別に水着のお仕事がダメっていう\nわけじゃないんですよ？　けど……。", "zh": "啊，也不是说泳装的工作不行哦？只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e25eea862c08e9aa5b38416ff5666e74d1691a45c97671032438f46eecab5c3", "ja": "夏だったのもあって、最近、ちょっと続いてたから。\nたまには、清楚な衣装とかで撮影したいな……なんて。", "zh": "正好又是夏天，最近这种工作也有点多了。\n所以……偶尔也想穿着清纯的服装拍摄一次……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "424bf5d29bff47a2fcfc04941ccb066b9ebef0015712b0d32649be643852f956", "ja": "そういえば……最近の風花さんのお仕事、\nグラビアが多かったですよね。", "zh": "说起来……风花小姐最近的工作，确实有不少写真拍摄呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "b81da6c47085d246225588adfd29a3c542f9fb93080272906fefca16d258e33f", "ja": "風花さん。イヤな時は、{$P$}に\nガツンと言った方がいいですよ！", "zh": "风花。觉得讨厌的时候，就该对{$P$}先生直截了当地说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "60432397634cdb2c58637e0563e2a08a251cd98a03282df306ebfcd67a014f92", "ja": "ガツンと……う、うん！\nでも、言えるかなぁ……？", "zh": "狠狠地说……嗯、嗯！\n不过，我真的说得出口吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "265efae65ff3ac77f0b4d3498cae03500610d8a3d462d949c2dc1b16460734fc", "ja": "風花ちゃんは優しいから……。けど\n{$P$}さんのことだし、何か……。", "zh": "风花很温柔，所以……可是，毕竟是{$P$}先生，总觉得会有点什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1011_se", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "ace1b658911e7472b2fb2e1e1d23a190880a733670123cbe779d43dd2b731e7b", "ja": "はいほー！　まつり姫の登場なので……ほ？\n{$P$}さん、まだ来ていないのです？", "zh": "嗨哟——！茉莉公主登场啦……咦？  \n{$P$}先生还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "04da4e3ed5945f975754edb9f775669709d674e846e917b94d9e91f5b0c9c5e8", "ja": "遅刻なんて珍しいですね？\nもしかして、劇場で迷子になってたりして！", "zh": "迟到还真少见呢？该不会是在剧场里迷路了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "d3bf697a93c3421307d10f83c544a5b48cdd47fe65254138c151ebd239a0ba74", "ja": "まつり、麗花さん、お疲れさま。私がさっき\n通りかかった時は、まだ事務室で仕事してたわ。", "zh": "茉莉、丽花，辛苦了。我刚才\n路过的时候，还在办公室工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c58d7d9d3c19f03a6648bb201827d696e68504e3bb76fd0d392f88deca108a85", "ja": "あっ……じゃあ私、呼んでくるね。\nみんなは、ここで待ってて。", "zh": "啊……那我去叫她们过来吧。\n大家在这里等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1016_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2485c1ded7de056916a62736ffd0c88daf2bfafa9de0e8f1e44e039fdb446e18", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす…………あっ。", "zh": "辛苦了——……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "95c4c38da3b147da2d172ca5641b35cf4c3c3f267021a5ef0d6d2d0625582827", "ja": "{$P$}さん、電話中だったのね。\nすこし待ってよう……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生正在打电话呀。\n稍微等等看吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ea4c0b0a7b8aa3ee730b90c5474d229fe9900400a4da395762a5345d2b0185ec", "ja": "新規の案件……インタビューとグラビアですか。\nはいっ、いつもありがとうございます！", "zh": "新的工作……是采访和写真拍摄吗？\n好的，非常感谢您一直以来的关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e496b213b1cb453e66a2a6f99bcd35440a668dd4710029989293115ee67dcc0d", "ja": "新しいお仕事？\nインタビューと、グラビア……って、まさか。", "zh": "新的工作？\n采访和写真……等等，难不成……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1021_p", "source_sha256": "745fbbdb7db81334d1356d1c8794a71450758e5af78cba9eb4bd4c166039def5", "ja": "ちなみに、水着の撮影はありますか？　……なるほど。\nそれでしたら、はい。ぜひ、豊川を第一候補で！", "zh": "顺便问一下，有泳装拍摄吗？……原来如此。\n那样的话，好的。请务必把丰川作为第一候选人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4bc8cf36d32c70c478a203043546f90e2e20e4edc75f63f3dbde9cf67412cd1f", "ja": "わ、私！？", "zh": "我、我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dfa96ff594a56b71a436e0544fbd9a1ee0a9d24d47e9a5b4d5003ffa892bd730", "ja": "夏の間は、水着のお仕事が多いのも仕方がないかって\n思ってたけど。もしかして、ずっとこのまま……？", "zh": "夏天泳装工作多，我本来还觉得也是没办法的事。\n难道说，以后一直都会是这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dcb407fb62e6cd9319b4d18fe1e2a486d240517b82504466246e7a6773bcfdef", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。私だって、水着じゃない\nお仕事がしたいんだもの。が、ガツンと言わなくちゃ！", "zh": "嗯……确实是这样。我也想接不是泳装的工作啊。得、得强硬地说出来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bec09c4eb915e0683451f0272ab4079c9ce55b27d97bde979aab54803e81ae52", "ja": "わかりました。詳しいお話は今度の打ち合わせで。\nそれでは失礼します！", "zh": "明白了。详细情况我们下次开会时再谈。那么先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1026_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2fca8e9a089458d9eeffbe5b113076e9223e0622ede08b2cf689b22c96e0a1f5", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　わ、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！我、我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1028_p", "source_sha256": "83ddc5c708440345170ad286411987b77effd7820dd660e4c2bd04f4f3e5d5f0", "ja": "あ、風花。ちょうどいいところに！\n実は、風花に新しい仕事の話があって……。", "zh": "啊，风花。你来得正好！\n其实，有份新工作的事想和你说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "58802d61e9cff519b0ca8e51dcead8a512dc11ec771b6324da937a0d5d88d214", "ja": "みっ……水着のお仕事は、しませんから！\n……{$P$}さんの、バカーッ！", "zh": "我……我才不会接泳装的工作呢！\n……{$P$}先生，大笨蛋——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4c04fcc999bc5b82bd42921930819821783cd1024bc077c9e1e190fa14ab4982", "ja": "えっ、風花！？　ちょっと待っ……！", "zh": "咦，风花！？等一下——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1031_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1032_p", "source_sha256": "622b53b9fee727300e95588741b94ee5dae1a0e9744131f1dc2c9ec891446718", "ja": "こ、このタイミングで電話……！\nはい、765プロです！", "zh": "这、这个时候打电话……！\n喂，这里是765制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1033_null", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1034_p", "source_sha256": "16cedf0cfc21343e696a0f1a1b5efc1ab74e6fbc790b2a7d0b3b14fa0b1ccef0", "ja": "ハア、ハア……みんな、遅れてすまない！\n……あ、あれ？　風花は？", "zh": "呼、呼……大家，抱歉我迟到了！\n……咦，咦？风花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "a04ec732d78dcc3e78bc1f6d9fc381c593365ae21dc06b55f7b377d52264d464", "ja": "遅いですよ、{$P$}。\n風花さん、次の仕事があるって帰っちゃいましたよ？", "zh": "您来得太晚了，{$P$}先生。风花小姐说接下来还有工作，就先回去了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "d768d0c7fe4211db4750b1004d9f661d54c0b2b93008e1a399d9e2b6210a3c92", "ja": "風花さん、なんだか怒ってたみたいですけど……\n何かあったんですか？", "zh": "风花小姐好像有点生气……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1037_p", "source_sha256": "681fd5e9299f01d5e2142ddb16f3a9ab3126f97c45ada9e8be873391bed71447", "ja": "いや、何もしてないけど……新しい仕事の話を\nしようと思ったら、逃げられてしまって。", "zh": "我什么也没做……只是想和她谈谈新工作的事，结果她却逃走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "0ae35842b25a75ff9081a327dbb94b18fc695597880b4ef61c7c2ad4701cd743", "ja": "風花ちゃん、水着がどうとか言ってたのです。\nもしかして、グラビアなのです？", "zh": "风花妹妹刚才说了什么泳装之类的。难道是拍写真吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1039_p", "source_sha256": "b38bab860fd84c8f61fd11e72fad670f854505aa7d971bed5de42e77888a76c0", "ja": "グラビアもあるけど、今回は水着の仕事じゃないんだ。\nファッション誌の、働く女性に向けた特集で……。", "zh": "虽然也有写真拍摄，但这次不是泳装工作。\n是时尚杂志面向职场女性的专题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1040_p", "source_sha256": "bd1be8bc1b5b5db968f7ad146dd59048ee874f07acc05fa7651f265e2f225a26", "ja": "元看護師の風花に、ピッタリだと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "我觉得这份工作和曾经当过护士的风花特别合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f9466cb0b3c04462624d289899a95c8dfa273a26b0324b51c0a22e315f46862", "ja": "わぁ～、本当ですね！　……あれ？\nけど、それならどうして怒っちゃったんでしょう？", "zh": "哇～，真的呢！……咦？\n不过，既然这样，她为什么会生气呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "14f25f88c59bccf20657a353915bd03b8b0622efb3f50d7ea9cf1026019aadf7", "ja": "もしかして、水着のお仕事と勘違いしたのかも……？\n風花ちゃん、すこしそそっかしいところがあるから。", "zh": "该不会是误以为要穿泳装工作了吧……？\n风花有时就是有点冒冒失失的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "f20d41835641876c11c4d5e1c8511de38059f5c13237d18c3d466f4cc33a539f", "ja": "私が煽っちゃったせいかしら……。けど、それもこれも\n日ごろから水着の仕事が多いせいだと思いますよ？", "zh": "该不会是因为我说的话把她给带偏了吧……。不过，这一切归根结底，我觉得还是因为平时接的水着工作太多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1044_p", "source_sha256": "17567371b30557c41825fa593d81f40b228a42cdf1eee77d5ec5482979727173", "ja": "確かに、そこは否定しようがないな……。\nとにかく、風花にきちんと説明しないとな。", "zh": "确实，这一点没法否认……\n不管怎样，得好好跟风花解释清楚才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d957b8ff672e8c33393da882f5fcb42bfb95da7c44921f782e2b684942743be7", "ja": "みんなも、集まってくれて申し訳ないけど、\n公演の話は日を改めて説明させてくれ。", "zh": "大家都特意赶来了，真是不好意思，\n公演的事情改天再向你们好好说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1046_p", "source_sha256": "a0250f114ff8e71547e7bae9e078382d19f0315df39852a190fceb02b9b014a3", "ja": "（その後、何度か風花に電話をかけてみたが、\nずっと留守電のままだった……）", "zh": "（之后，我试着给风花打了好几次电话，却一直都只有语音留言……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_092_1047_p", "source_sha256": "d9645b7e28c0b3bc8d7d87d501e18db7b1fb2fbb580c628cf62b35604b57037f", "ja": "（仕方がない……明日、きちんと話そう）", "zh": "（没办法……明天再好好谈吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
